eration of B. But we must make a contribution now. Could propose provisional recommendation for Candidate C, noting concerns.\n\nLet's do that. Provide evidence: reliability 100%, correct decisions quickly, positive crew atmosphere. Acknowledge concerns: communication difficulty, egocentric, not willing to further education. Explain why still best: strengths outweigh concerns, other candidates have more severe cooperation or reliability issues.\n\nThus vote for Candidate C.\n\nProceed."}
